{"unit_id":"davidLi17__dsh-startup-animation#card-zh","repo":"davidLi17/dsh-startup-animation","commit":"acdc16fdd08cfa4c4e4dc91ed4a72a9fff18efc7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-startup-animation 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的启动开场插件，通过 shell.overlay 覆盖槽位在主界面上方挂载动画层。内置开场依次呈现鲸鱼、人物、扫描线、环形光轨、横幅、字标和 HARNESS，约三秒后淡出；用户可点击画面或按 Esc 跳过。也可通过浏览器 localStorage 选择自定义图片或视频、调整内置动画速度，或关闭开场。适合希望定制 DSH 启动体验的桌面端用户；无需 API Key 或外部账号，自定义媒体需由页面可访问的 URL 提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:434-560","lib/client.js:462-523","cordis.patch.yml:3-5"]}
{"unit_id":"davidLi17__dsh-startup-animation#card-en","repo":"davidLi17/dsh-startup-animation","commit":"acdc16fdd08cfa4c4e4dc91ed4a72a9fff18efc7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-startup-animation adds a startup overlay through DSH's shell.overlay slot. Its three-second brand animation can be skipped by click or Esc. localStorage selects custom image or video, changes speed, or disables the intro. No key or account is needed; custom media needs a page-accessible URL.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:434-560","lib/client.js:462-523","cordis.patch.yml:3-5"]}
